WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.037 --> 00:00:05.139
"Please help!" Sam said.

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.652
"I was playing with Lenny.

3
00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:09.805
Now I can't find him.

4
00:00:09.806 --> 00:00:12.633
He's lost!"

5
00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.488
Cora crossed two of her arms.

6
00:00:15.489 --> 00:00:18.287
"No way," she said.

7
00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:21.668
"I'm not falling for your tricks anymore!"

8
00:00:21.669 --> 00:00:24.233
Sam begged and begged.

9
00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:27.068
But Cora ignored Sam.

10
00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:33.412
Finally Sam swam away.

11
00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:37.050
"Why didn't you help him?" Mo asked.

12
00:00:37.051 --> 00:00:40.600
Cora told Mo about the tricks.

13
00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:43.761
"I don't think that was a trick," Mo said.

14
00:00:43.762 --> 00:00:48.067
"Sam looked really worried."

15
00:00:48.068 --> 00:00:53.468
Cora sighed. "Ugh, okay.

16
00:00:53.469 --> 00:01:08.028
Let's see if the compass can help."

17
00:01:08.029 --> 00:01:13.942
The compass showed a picture of Lenny.

18
00:01:13.943 --> 00:01:20.041
Then the arrow took off.

19
00:01:20.042 --> 00:01:24.995
Cora and Mo swam after it.

20
00:01:24.996 --> 00:01:30.540
Soon they arrived at the Seaweed Forest.

21
00:01:30.541 --> 00:01:37.788
"Lenny must be lost in there," Mo said.

22
00:01:37.789 --> 00:01:43.303
The two friends swam into the forest.

23
00:01:43.304 --> 00:01:48.134
They looked between plants.

24
00:01:48.135 --> 00:02:01.094
They peeked under rocks.

25
00:02:01.095 --> 00:02:04.638
Finally they spotted Lenny.

26
00:02:04.639 --> 00:02:07.545
"Lenny!" Cora shouted.

27
00:02:07.546 --> 00:02:15.407
The clownfish was shaking. "Cora! Mo!

28
00:02:15.408 --> 00:02:20.236
I was playing with Sam—and got lost."

29
00:02:20.237 --> 00:02:23.586
"We'll take you home," Cora said.

30
00:02:23.587 --> 00:02:26.600
They turned to leave.

31
00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:36.574
Mo gasped. "Barracudas!"

